<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督Torey Malatia，他提醒你——

00:58:36.550 --> 00:58:38.400
<v Adam Davidson>Don't die in Utah.
<v Adam Davidson>别死在犹他州。

00:58:38.400 --> 00:58:41.640
<v Ira Glass>Back next week with more stories of This American Life . I'm Ira Glass.
<v Ira Glass>下周回来收听更多《美国生活》的故事。我是艾拉·格拉斯。

00:58:41.640 --> 00:58:42.750
<v Barry Glass>I'm Barry Glass.
<v Barry Glass>我是巴里·格拉斯。

00:58:42.750 --> 00:58:43.980
<v Ira Glass>Don't drive like my father.
<v Ira Glass>别像我父亲那样开车。

00:58:43.980 --> 00:58:45.940
<v Barry Glass>Please don't drive like my son.
<v Barry Glass>请别像我儿子那样开车。

00:58:45.940 --> 00:58:55.710
<v Sarah Vowell>And don't drive like me.
<v Sarah Vowell>也别像我这样开车。

